# Phase 4 — Query-Aware Workflows, Structured Output & FastAPI Service

## Summary
Completed Build Phase 4:
1. Updated `FlaggedItem` schema and `ReportingTool` to fetch and populate full structured `account_record` (`AccountRecord`) and `recent_transactions` (`list[TransactionRecord]`) domain models for every flagged suspicious item.
2. Implemented all 5 dynamic routing paths (`pattern_search`, `aggregation_query`, `entity_lookup`, `broad_eda`, `risk_scoring_batch`) with exact tool selection and skipping.
3. Created `src/api/main.py` offering a production-grade FastAPI REST service with `POST /query`, `GET /health`, `GET /audit/{query_id}`, and interactive OpenAPI / Swagger UI at `/docs` and ReDoc at `/redoc`.
4. Updated `main.py` root CLI entry point with command-line arguments (`--query`, `--provider`, `--model`, `--format json|summary`) and terminal formatted output.
5. Implemented aggressive workflow unit & integration test suites in `tests/test_phase4_workflows.py` and `tests/test_api.py`.

